          %p The degree of the zero polynomial is undefined, since the left shift of the zero polynomial is never non-zero.
          %h3#polynomials_in_a_finite_number_of_indeterminates Polynomials in a finite number of indeterminates
          %p
            Let us define the standard
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+set"} finite set
